Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.88,0:00:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,人的死因多种多样
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.59,0:00:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,老死
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.71,0:00:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,自杀
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.75,0:00:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,病死
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.26,0:00:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,如今世界上最令世人恐惧的死因是…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.43,0:00:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,烧死
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.52,0:00:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,好烫
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.07,0:00:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,新门大队长 你跑哪里去了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.78,0:00:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,别说你已经把我们给忘了
