Dialogue: 2,0:22:32.10,0:22:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,敌人很强大
Dialogue: 2,0:22:33.73,0:22:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,谜团还有很多没解开
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.77,0:22:36.23,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\an7}指引方向
Dialogue: 1,0:22:33.77,0:22:36.23,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6}{\an7}指引方向
